{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879358",
      "title": "Redirecting & \"Catch All\" Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 179,
      "videoOrder": 155,
      "sourceHash": "0299e5076e9722ecdceaac98f9b69f0d9478619e25bd88c905d7f5961e65b33d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 4.456,
          "en": "Now in this demo app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.456,
          "end": 5.98,
          "en": "we've been working on thus far,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.98,
          "end": 7.697,
          "en": "we actually have one problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.697,
          "end": 10.3,
          "en": "\"Teams\" works, \"Users\" works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.3,
          "end": 13.08,
          "en": "and we can view our team's members.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 17.33,
          "en": "But in reality most users would probably reach this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.33,
          "end": 19.49,
          "en": "by just entering your domain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.49,
          "end": 22.44,
          "en": "And if you do that, you don't have an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.44,
          "end": 24.763,
          "en": "but you also don't see anything on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.22,
          "end": 29.62,
          "en": "The reason for that can actually be seen in the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.62,
          "end": 32.18,
          "en": "The router doesn't find any matching route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.18,
          "end": 33.86,
          "en": "for \"slash nothing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.86,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "So, for just our domain \"slash nothing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 39.43,
          "en": "And that's not a technical error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.43,
          "end": 42.07,
          "en": "but it might not be what you intended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.07,
          "end": 43.76,
          "en": "You definitely might wanna handle this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.76,
          "end": 46.19,
          "en": "and display something on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.19,
          "end": 49.03,
          "en": "Now, it of course depends on the kind of app you're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.03,
          "end": 50.54,
          "en": "and which routes you wanna have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.54,
          "end": 53.87,
          "en": "Maybe you'll have some component which you wanna show here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.87,
          "end": 57.53,
          "en": "Maybe you simply want to show the team's list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.53,
          "end": 60.11,
          "en": "if the user enters \"slash nothing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.11,
          "end": 63.3,
          "en": "But here I want to have \"slash teams\" in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.3,
          "end": 64.92,
          "en": "when team's lists are shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.92,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "Simply to kind of have an expressive URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 71.22,
          "en": "which is all the describing the type",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.22,
          "end": 73.153,
          "en": "of content we're seeing on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.06,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "Of course I still wanna add a new route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 78.51,
          "en": "as a first route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 81.37,
          "en": "Which is \"path slash nothing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.37,
          "end": 83.81,
          "en": "Which should be responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.81,
          "end": 85.763,
          "en": "for loading team's list as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 91.623,
          "en": "Now as I've just said, we can offload team's list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.11,
          "end": 95.71000000000001,
          "en": "Save this, and now see our teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.71000000000001,
          "end": 97.5,
          "en": "when we visit \"slash nothing.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 99.28999999999999,
          "en": "And everything will work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.61,
          "en": "but I always wanna have \"slash teams\" in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.61,
          "end": 106.6,
          "en": "and not just \"slash nothing\" for loading the team's lists.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.6,
          "end": 108.92,
          "en": "So therefore, actually what I wanna do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.92,
          "end": 112.723,
          "en": "is I don't wanna load the team's list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.86,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "Instead I wanna redirect to this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 119.00999999999999,
          "en": "And that's possible with the router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 122.19,
          "en": "In the route conflict, you have another option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 123.85,
          "en": "which you can set on a route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.85,
          "end": 126.86,
          "en": "And that's the redirect property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.86,
          "end": 131.263,
          "en": "And you can set this to a path you wanna redirect to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "So that if \"slash nothing\" is entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 136.823,
          "en": "we redirect to teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 141.44,
          "en": "And of course you can redirect to any path you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.44,
          "end": 143.02,
          "en": "And if I save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.56,
          "end": 148.32999999999998,
          "en": "and I now enter my domain \"slash nothing,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.32999999999998,
          "end": 151.7,
          "en": "if I had enter, you see it changes to \"slash teams\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.7,
          "end": 156.163,
          "en": "and we redirect it to this page by the view router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.04,
          "end": 158.89,
          "en": "So that's a pretty nice feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.89,
          "end": 160.15,
          "en": "Being able to redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.15,
          "end": 162.65,
          "en": "It is something which you might need a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.65,
          "end": 164.28300000000002,
          "en": "in your applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.37,
          "end": 168.53,
          "en": "There also is kind of an alternative to redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.53,
          "end": 171.923,
          "en": "You could also set the alias option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.99,
          "end": 176.93,
          "en": "Well, you would actually not set it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.93,
          "end": 178.86,
          "en": "instead you would remove this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 180.81,
          "en": "and go to the route you wanna load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.81,
          "end": 182.68,
          "en": "when this route is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.68,
          "end": 184.44,
          "en": "And then add alias to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.44,
          "end": 187.51,
          "en": "So, in this case the \"slash teams\" route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 187.51,
          "end": 190.07,
          "en": "And here you then add your alias path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.07,
          "end": 192.54,
          "en": "which leads to the same component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.54,
          "end": 194.86,
          "en": "So, here \"slash nothing\" would be an alias",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.86,
          "end": 196.8,
          "en": "for \"slash teams.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.8,
          "end": 199.4,
          "en": "If you do that and you enter \"slash nothing,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 199.4,
          "end": 201.97,
          "en": "we still load the \"team members\" component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.97,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "So, it's a bit like defining \"slash nothing\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 206.62,
          "en": "with component team's list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.62,
          "end": 208.94,
          "en": "as we did it a couple of minutes ago.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.94,
          "end": 211.53300000000002,
          "en": "With alias you can write this on a shorter forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.43,
          "end": 214.85,
          "en": "But of course, the downside, which I don't wanna have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 214.85,
          "end": 218.72,
          "en": "in this use case, is that the URL doesn't change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 218.72,
          "end": 220.81,
          "en": "And that's the difference to a redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.81,
          "end": 223.72,
          "en": "With a redirect the URL is changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.72,
          "end": 227.47,
          "en": "You are really redirected to a different path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.47,
          "end": 231.14,
          "en": "With an alias, the URL does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.14,
          "end": 235.1,
          "en": "You just load the same component as on a different route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.1,
          "end": 238.21,
          "en": "And it depends on your requirements and your application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.21,
          "end": 240.15,
          "en": "which behavior you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.15,
          "end": 243.29,
          "en": "I don't want an alias here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.29,
          "end": 247.37,
          "en": "Instead I want to redirect as I did it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.37,
          "end": 249.6,
          "en": "I want to redirect with \"slash teams,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.6,
          "end": 252.06,
          "en": "save everything and therefore make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.06,
          "end": 255.567,
          "en": "that when I enter nothing, I end up on \"slash teams.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 257.054,
          "end": 260.16,
          "en": "Another thing which we're not handling in this demo here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.16,
          "end": 264.21,
          "en": "is the use case that the user enters any route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.21,
          "end": 265.57,
          "en": "which is not supported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 265.57,
          "end": 267.91,
          "en": "So, here \"slash something.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 267.91,
          "end": 270.09,
          "en": "if I enter this again, we see nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.09,
          "end": 273.4,
          "en": "Because we have no route defined for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 273.4,
          "end": 278.12,
          "en": "Now of course we can't define routes for all possible values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.12,
          "end": 279.43,
          "en": "that could be entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.43,
          "end": 283.283,
          "en": "There is an infinite amount of paths the user could enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 284.33,
          "end": 288.85,
          "en": "That's why you can define \"catch all\" routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 288.85,
          "end": 291.36,
          "en": "So here I'll add a new route at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 291.36,
          "end": 293.86,
          "en": "because it should have the lowest priority",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 293.86,
          "end": 297.92,
          "en": "and only kick in if no other route handles this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.92,
          "end": 302.29,
          "en": "But here the path should be slash and then something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 302.29,
          "end": 303.55,
          "en": "which tells the router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 303.55,
          "end": 306.053,
          "en": "that anything should match this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 307.09,
          "end": 309.37,
          "en": "And for that you add a dynamic segment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 309.37,
          "end": 312.99,
          "en": "then any name of your choice for example \"not found\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 315.87,
          "en": "or \"catch all,\" whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.87,
          "end": 317.82,
          "en": "I'll go with \"not found.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.82,
          "end": 321.717,
          "en": "And then brackets, and in the brackets \"dot star.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.63,
          "end": 326.19,
          "en": "This certainly looks strange but in the end this means,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 326.19,
          "end": 328.3,
          "en": "it's a dynamic segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 328.3,
          "end": 331.37,
          "en": "And this here is actually a regular expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 331.37,
          "end": 333.86,
          "en": "This text is supported by the view router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.86,
          "end": 337.99,
          "en": "And it simply means any character combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 337.99,
          "end": 340.45,
          "en": "which is being used as a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 340.45,
          "end": 343.5,
          "en": "should in the handle lead to this route being loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 343.5,
          "end": 345.65999999999997,
          "en": "That's why this needs to come last.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 345.65999999999997,
          "end": 348.81,
          "en": "Otherwise it would also overwrite the other routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 348.81,
          "end": 349.86,
          "en": "which you wanna have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 350.78,
          "end": 355.13,
          "en": "But if none of these routes is handling the entry path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 355.13,
          "end": 357.21,
          "en": "this route should kick in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 357.21,
          "end": 360.2,
          "en": "And here you can define which component should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 360.2,
          "end": 361.28,
          "en": "in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 361.28,
          "end": 363.02,
          "en": "Or if you wanna redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 363.02,
          "end": 366.23,
          "en": "For example, we could redirect to \"slash teams\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 366.23,
          "end": 368.98,
          "en": "for any invalid value that's being entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 368.98,
          "end": 372.423,
          "en": "So, if I saved this and I enter something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 373.71,
          "end": 376.35,
          "en": "I'm redirected to \"slash teams.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 376.35,
          "end": 381.35,
          "en": "Alternatively you create a \"not found\" component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 383.06,
          "end": 385.54,
          "en": "Let's say, here in the Nav folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 385.54,
          "end": 389.493,
          "en": "With a simple template where I say, \"Page not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 391.527,
          "end": 394.973,
          "en": "\"Maybe view our\" and then a router link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 397.497,
